


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_5b9e852c:


    "——还没想过那么遥远的事情。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_ef3586eb:


    "文没加颜文字或是表情，直接打了几个字发送后便关上了app。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_2674db4f:



    voice "2FU_0941RE"
    fumi "「嗯，那我们在超市买好东西一起回去吧♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_de209586:


    "将手机收入包中比平时更深的地方后，文抬起手臂，大步前行。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_e9a5d63d:



    voice "2HI_1190"
    hina "「唔、嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_1b595c6a:


    "阳菜忙追上她，然后牵起文的手与她十指相扣。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_c304d562:



    voice "2FU_0942RE"
    fumi "「啊哈，今天好忙，有没有觉得饿了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_d442641a:



    voice "2HI_1191"
    hina "「嗯！饿瘪了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_e8cdec37:



    voice "2FU_0943RE"
    fumi "「阳菜有什么想吃的？什么都可以做给你，尽管说出来♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_48b2a35f:



    voice "2HI_1192"
    hina "「嗯，吃什么呢。不过只要是小文做的，不管是什么都特别好吃」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_f3f33681:



    voice "2FU_0944RE"
    fumi "「啊哈哈，你这么说我就没白做」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_11dfbfea:



    voice "2HI_1193"
    hina "「嗯，我也会帮你打下手的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_933e3cfc:



    voice "2FU_0945RE"
    fumi "「今天真是让阳菜帮了好多忙呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_54646ca0:



    voice "2HI_1194"
    hina "「当然了，因为……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_72a0e249:


    "人行横道的信号灯变成了红灯。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_63500ca0:


    "一列一列的汽车从两人眼前驶过，遮挡住了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_7cd05578:



    voice "2HI_1195"
    hina "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_b2c9b068:



    voice "2FU_0946"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_80a2dccc:


    "正好是回家的时间，车来车往不断。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_dca08989:



    voice "2HI_1196"
    hina "「我们能在一起多久呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_f24d51b5:


    "阳菜看着对面的红绿灯轻语。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_01_d49d6675:


    "两人握紧了牵在一起的手。"
